 AWS is trying to get the metadata from the instance by calling this URL `169.254.169.254:80`.\r\n\r\nI did not test but I believe that IAM Profile won't work.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/281159712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dadoonet","id":274222,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDIyMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274222?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet","html_url":"https://github.com/dadoonet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dadoonet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":971397766,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDk3MTM5Nzc2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/events/971397766","actor":{"login":"Tim-Brooks","id":862472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MjQ3Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/862472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks","html_url":"https://github.com/Tim-Brooks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Brooks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tim-Bro